{"data":{"body":"[P2] An interrupted close exits while continuation registrations remain and skips `validateRunningThreads()` and `checkpointManager.shutdown()`, allowing queued work and delayed backend requests to outlive invocation cleanup. Continue draining and shut down the checkpoint manager before restoring or propagating interruption, and add an interrupted-close regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7747-a","finding_digest":"47161be44c2843f16c2214eca9516c2b482387f83afaa42cd5541c8b65f52dae","finding_id":"arf_v1_i4lbxzcmfbb7c3bcctwksulmfn","finding_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::stopcheckpointcontinuations::interrupted-drain","identity_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::stopcheckpointcontinuations::interrupted-drain","line":774,"observation_digest":"b6b642abc92bef6ef047497344683e007dd6c7d3e841e7779fff3dda05d89222","observation_id":"aro_v1_w23efk6jfpxw54chjfzui2b6ab","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_i4lbxzcmfbb7c3bcctwksulmfn","published_at":"2026-10-09T02:18:47Z","review_id":"arr_v1_hgsrvgnlqzk66aa6xqgw2hpwai","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"f9bba67b5ac08ace2bfcac2ee4e6a5c4ff39c85b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":771,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":765},"record_id":"art_v1_36sc4deu7iarwe7kiugjnrduql","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T02:18:47Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
